# Licence

This repository holds two different things, and they are not licensed the same
way.

## The paper

Everything in `src/content/`, `src/data/` and `public/audio/` — the manuscript
of *Friction — The Silent Killer*, its Insights, its narration and the editorial
material around it — is:

**© 2026 TROi Arkitektur AB. Written by Christoffer Råsten.**

Licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution–NonCommercial–NoDerivatives
4.0 International Licence (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0)**.

<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/>

In plain words: you are welcome to read it, quote it with attribution, and pass
it on. You may not sell it, and you may not publish a changed version of it.

Quoting for review, teaching, or argument is exactly what it is for. If you want
to translate it, adapt it, or use it somewhere the licence does not stretch to,
ask — the answer is usually yes.

